<task id="033" project="spaarke-SPA-external-access-platform-r2">
  <metadata>
    <title>SPIKE: evaluate the business-user NDA redline surface (reuse all NDA plumbing)</title>
    <phase>P3 Legal Front Door intake MVP</phase>
    <gate>blocked-until:032</gate>
    <status>not-started</status>
    <rigor>STANDARD</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Planning spike — investigation + options + recommendation + decision record; NO production code (rigor STANDARD per kit spike rule). Gates the outcome-(b) redline build (a follow-on).</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Bounded evaluation of existing plumbing (ReviewMemo* / ComposeShadowPatchEngine / app-only decoupling) against a defined persona; produces a decision doc, no architecture invention.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
