    <patterns>
      <pattern name="Spike decision record" location="projects/spaarke-SPA-external-access-platform-r2/notes/">Investigate → options → recommendation → decision record; no production code; gate the downstream build.</pattern>
      <pattern name="ADR conflict resolution" location="CLAUDE.md §6.5">Surface the advisory-only tension with an explicit A/B/C path for owner sign-off.</pattern>
    </patterns>
  </knowledge>
  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="1">Investigate: read ReviewMemoDocumentBuilder + IExportService (what the memo artifact is + how it's exported), ComposeShadowPatchEngine (what a true tracked-change redline would take + its ADR-049 write/save posture), and the agreement-review Action's advisory-only prompt constraint. Confirm the app-only vs OBO/Compose-save boundary for each.</step>
    <step order="2">Options: enumerate the candidate business-user redline surfaces — (i) Review Summary Memo (before/after table, download/email; advisory, exists today), (ii) tracked-change DOCX via a finding→edit synthesizer feeding ComposeShadowPatchEngine (novel/hard; ADR-tensioned), (iii) inline edit list only (no artifact). For each: reuse cost, app-only viability, fidelity to the non-attorney persona, ADR-tension exposure.</step>
    <step order="3">Recommend: pick the surface + artifact for the non-attorney SPA persona; name exactly which plumbing to expose + the minimal new adapter/synthesizer (if any); resolve the app-only decoupling from OBO/Compose-save; state the §6.5 resolution path (A/B/C) for the advisory-only tension.</step>
    <step order="4">Define the FR-23 (b) production contract (what the endpoint returns for outcome (b) once the mock is replaced) + a follow-on build-task recommendation (scope, effort, whether it belongs in R2).</step>
    <step order="5">Write the decision doc to projects/spaarke-SPA-external-access-platform-r2/notes/nda-redline-surface-decision.md.</step>
    <step order="6">Update TASK-INDEX.md: set this task's status to ✅ completed.</step>
    <step order="7">Document any deviations in projects/spaarke-SPA-external-access-platform-r2/notes/.</step>
  </steps>
  <tools>
    <tool name="terminal">Shell for code inspection (read-only)</tool>
